{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Cover the full job with valid AWS credentials**\n\nThe assumed-role session defaults to one hour, while credentials are acquired before steps budgeted for 10 + 35 + 30 + 5 minutes. A slow but still in-budget run can hit `ExpiredToken` during assertions or the always-run evidence collection. Request a sufficiently long session if supported, or configure fresh credentials again before testing and collection.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc705BrU","finding_digest":"99810f243af070bf5920981293aec74261d1a947da0fe65f7641fc15b87871ea","finding_id":"arf_v1_tgaq6jb26byl6wjatajjhlwhij","finding_key":"github/workflows/lmi-e2e-tests.yml::cloud-job::credential-session-budget","identity_key":"github/workflows/lmi-e2e-tests.yml::cloud-job::credential-session-budget","line":64,"observation_digest":"bf115cdc91f04349b70e69f2b68b3d32ec2fedbfa2919f4e41b10b514bf767f5","observation_id":"aro_v1_x4ivzxer6bbutnyonhzlncz5gl","path":".github/workflows/lmi-e2e-tests.yml","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-25T20:59:18Z","review_id":"arr_v1_sy7h523yclab4zkuqwdodvdalo","reviewed_base_sha":"518cba16e0e690e1939feff222915ce841aa960b","reviewed_head_sha":"4f7ca72e4d42d0b067342a566230a04e9fb60198","reviewer":"codex","start_line":59,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":728},"record_id":"art_v1_vwsuntr4ev7sgsplidqx2c4vul","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-25T20:59:18Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
